","name":"needs testing","color":"ffcc44","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":580537003,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw1ODA1MzcwMDM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdextension","name":"topic:gdextension","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2026-06-25T12:41:53Z","updated_at":"2026-06-25T17:00:01Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: 4.7.stable.\n\n### System information\n\nNot relevant\n\n### Issue description\n\nThe documentation for the `hint` field of `GDExtensionPropertyInfo` states that `PropertyHint` is\n> Bitfield of PropertyHint (defined in extension_api.json).\n\nBut extension_api.json states that it's not:\n>   {\n>     \"name\": \"PropertyHint\",\n>     \"is_bitfield\": false,\n\nI guess, the `extension_api.json` is of the higher precedence, and the [Godot sources](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/fd98f8452afdc80236ba01f69f27537f5a368dc1/core/object/property_info.h#L128) also point on it being just an `enum` (and therefore `int32_t`).\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Dump the files in question \n  - Run `godot --headless --dump-gdextension-interface-json`\n  - Run `godot --headless --dump-extension-api[-with-docs]`\n2. Look for the `description` conflicts\n  - `GDExtensionPropertyInfo`'s `hint` member in `gdextension_interface.json`\n  - `PropertyHint`'s `is_bitfield` property\n\n(There is also a typo in the `GDExtensionMethodInfo`'s `argument_count` field)\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120635/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120635/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}